This project builds on the following works, distributed under the Apache License 2.0:

* Qwen2.5-VL (Qwen Team, Alibaba Cloud), through its implementation in Hugging Face
  Transformers (Copyright The HuggingFace Inc. team).
* Q-Zoom (https://github.com/YuHengsss/Q-Zoom). ReMAP starts from the Q-Zoom
  Qwen2.5-VL-7B checkpoint, and its Twig locator is initialised from Q-Zoom's
  SD-RPN branch layers.

The access-policy optimisation follows the partial-rollout idea of ARPO
(https://github.com/RUC-NLPIR/ARPO); no ARPO code is included.
